# H2Sentry Frontend Environment Configuration
# In local development, the Vite proxy directs /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000
# In production (Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages), point this to your deployed FastAPI backend URL:
# Example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://h2sentry-backend.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
